        attributes and payload of an existing L{RRHeader} instance.

        @type rrHeader: L{RRHeader}
        @param rrHeader: An L{RRHeader} instance containing an
            L{UnknownRecord} payload.

        @return: An instance of L{_OPTHeader}.
        @rtype: L{_OPTHeader}
